    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there is help out there but it doesnt feel like it matters. it feels like he took the whole world with him. everything is just grey. i look at the empty side of the bed and i just feel so heavy... like i'm just waiting for something to happen so i don't have to feel this anymore.",
